│   ├── start-dev-modes.ps1      Enhanced multi-mode launcher
│   ├── docker-compose.yml       Production stack
│   ├── docker-compose.dev.yml   Local dev stack
│   ├── Caddyfile                Active reverse proxy config (mode-switched)
│   └── server/                  Express.js application
└── UserData/                    Per-user runtime data (managed by server)
```

